---
// HowItWorksIntro.astro — Encabezado de «Cómo funciona»
---

<header class="section-intro" data-reveal="editorial">
  <div class="eyebrow-wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="eyebrow-text">CÓMO FUNCIONA</span>
  </div>

  <h2 id="how-it-works-title" class="section-title">
    Importas, pones la matrícula, emites.
  </h2>
</header>

<style>
  .section-intro {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .eyebrow-wrap {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .eyebrow-line {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .eyebrow-text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
